sub:quote a prov:Entity;
    prov:hadPrimarySource <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fractastical/delphisci/2404c437f822e1c98420130cd01e7972acf3ac57/books/levin-papers/inputs/2019-boundary.txt#line=109,110>;
    prov:wasQuotedFrom <https://doi.org/10.3389/fpsyg.2019.02688>;
    <https://schema.org/text> "The proposed crucial role of bioelectrics in multicellularity predicts that it should be possible to induce the formation of metazoan-like bodies in an otherwise unicellular organism by forcing the expression of appropriate electrogenic proteins and gap junctions. Similarly, it may be possible to induce dissolution of an entire metazoan body by appropriate changes of bioelectric dynamics.".
